<section class="operating-principles wrap" aria-labelledby="operating-principles-title"><div class="operating-principles-heading"><p class="eyebrow">How we work</p><h2 id="operating-principles-title">Broad ambition.<br>Specific choices.</h2></div><ol>
<li><h3>Give every product a clear purpose.</h3><p>Begin with a defined audience and a useful place in everyday life. Let that purpose guide what belongs in the experience.</p></li>
<li><h3>Make the next useful action clear.</h3><p>Treat design as part of how the product works. Clarity and consistency matter as much as visual character.</p></li>
<li><h3>Reuse the work. Keep the judgment.</h3><p>Develop workflows that may serve more than 1 product, while preserving the decisions each audience and problem needs.</p></li>
</ol></section>
